            {
              "text": "Words and music by Montrealer and Ultimatum organizer Alan Lord (me), except where noted otherwise. The electronic music of the four song/poems was executed by Boys du Sévère (Jean-Luc Bonspiel and Jean-Martin Mignault)."
            }
          ]
        }
